# ── SECTION 4 — DESIGN RULES (full spec in .context/design.lock) ─

Admin UI = UHNW luxury. NOT generic SaaS. NOT Notion. NOT Linear.

ALWAYS:  bg-background / bg-card (dark)  |  text-yellow-400 accent (gold)
         backdrop-blur-md on modals/headers  |  font-display on headings
         bg-muted animate-pulse skeletons  |  animate-in fade-in on entries

NEVER:   bg-white / bg-gray-50 / bg-gray-100  |  default blue shadcn buttons
         text-gray-900 / text-black on dark bg  |  solid white dialogs
         bg-gray-200 skeleton loaders

Before committing UI → run integrity grep from .context/design.lock

# ── SECTION 5 — DB FIELD NAMES (exact — wrong = runtime errors) ──

leads        : id, name, email, phone, message, status, lead_source, city, created_at
               NOT: full_name / service / source
projects     : id, title, slug, description, category_id, client_name, location,
               budget, status, views, image_url, created_at
               NOT: tags / categories
services     : id, name, slug, description, icon_name, image_url, display_order
               NOT: title  (it's "name")
blogs        : id, title, slug, excerpt, content, image_url, read_time, status,
               created_at, published_at
testimonials : id, name, role, content, rating, active
               NOT: author / is_active / is_featured
profiles     : id, full_name, avatar_url, role (admin|viewer)
               NOTE: profiles=full_name vs leads=name — different tables
estimate_leads: id, name, email, phone, project_type, property_size, quality_tier,
               timeline, estimate_total_min, estimate_total_max, status, created_at
               SECURITY: min/max = server-side only, never trust client values

# ── SECTION 6 — CODE PATTERNS ────────────────────────────────────

## Repository pattern (mandatory):
WRONG: const { data } = await supabase.from('leads').select(...)
RIGHT: import { leadRepo } from '@/repositories'
       const data = await leadRepo.getAll()

Repo files  : apps/web/src/repositories/interfaces/[Name]Repository.ts
Impls       : apps/web/src/repositories/Supabase[Name]Repo.ts
Barrel      : apps/web/src/repositories/index.ts

## React Query:
useQuery({ queryKey: ['leads'], queryFn: () => leadRepo.getAll() })
useMutation({ mutationFn: leadRepo.update,
  onSuccess: () => queryClient.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: ['leads'] }) })

## KPI counts — ?? 0 not || 0:
return count ?? 0   ✓   (|| 0 breaks when count legitimately equals zero)

## React Bits components:
Copy from  : tmp_react_bits/src/ts-tailwind/[Category]/[Name]/[Name].tsx
Place at   : apps/web/src/components/ReactBits/
Import     : import { TiltedCard, ShinyText, CountUp } from '@/components/ReactBits'
New comp   : follow tmp_react_bits/.context/new-component.md creation guide

