# ── SECTION 8 — AFTER EVERY TASK (mandatory state update) ────────

1. Rewrite .context/state.md:
   last_agent, last_updated, active_task, last_completed_task,
   files_modified_this_session, environment_state, notes_for_next_agent

2. Append one line to .context/decisions.log:
   [ISO timestamp] | [Model] | [ARCH/DB/UI/BUG/REVERT/BLOCK] | [Decision] | [Reason]

3. Append to progress.txt:
   [YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM] Completed: TaskName — brief note

The next model's ability to continue without breaking things depends on this.

